        "contract": "graph-math-step/v2",
        "display_unit": "transform",
        "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\begin{gathered}u=-x\\Longrightarrow x=-u\\\\(u,v)\\longmapsto(-u,v)\\end{gathered}\\\\\\begin{gathered}y=f(- x)\\ \\xrightarrow{\\text{向右平移 }2}\\ y=f(-(x - 2))=f(- x + 2)\\\\(- u,v)\\longmapsto(2 - u,v)\\end{gathered}\\\\\\begin{gathered}x_{1}<x_{2}\\Longrightarrow 2 - x_{1}>2 - x_{2}\\\\\\text{原图从左往右上升}\\Longrightarrow\\text{新图从左往右下降}\\end{gathered}\\end{gathered}$$",
